{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03364","headline":"夜渡吴松江怀古 · 宋之问","name":"夜渡吴松江怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿帆震泽口，晓渡松江濆。\n櫂发鱼龙气，舟冲鸿雁羣。\n寒潮顿觉满，暗浦稍将分。\n气出海生日，光清湖起云。\n水乡尽天衞，叹息爲吴君。\n谋士伏劒死，至今悲所闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}